(7599839, 1227404, 87808, '<td valign="top">I really like that not one ounce of this is in focus.  With it''s is muted, dull and  bland blues/greys, make this stunning! I can see this hanging on any sea side cottage wall.  I would have one!  Perfect! 8</td>', 'I really like that not one ounce of this is in focus.  With it''s is muted, dull and  bland blues/greys, make this stunning! I can see this hanging on any sea side cottage wall.  I would have one!  Perfect! 8', '2018-11-01 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599840, 1227700, 87808, '<td valign="top">What is there not to love about this shot. Love the leading lines everywhere, the colours are spectacular, the moss strewn rocks, the feathery water. lovely clouds. Excellent! I bet you got the wiggles when you edited this one!!! 10</td>', 'What is there not to love about this shot. Love the leading lines everywhere, the colours are spectacular, the moss strewn rocks, the feathery water. lovely clouds. Excellent! I bet you got the wiggles when you edited this one!!! 10', '2018-11-01 10:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599846, 1227781, 87808, '<td valign="top">The orange is lovely, reminds me of a Barry sunset</td>', 'The orange is lovely, reminds me of a Barry sunset', '2018-11-01 10:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599847, 1227472, 87808, '<td valign="top">IF you have your ISO on A or very high, you can take these photos fairly clearly.  Then adjust lightness in editing. Yu got a good shot, just needs to be more in focus or something in focus.</td>', 'IF you have your ISO on A or very high, you can take these photos fairly clearly.  Then adjust lightness in editing. Yu got a good shot, just needs to be more in focus or something in focus.', '2018-11-01 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599848, 1228017, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, is this spectacular. And assembly! Adore the muted pink and greys in the background with the grain, totally makes this stand out for me, at least.  Well done!</td>', 'Well, is this spectacular. And assembly! Adore the muted pink and greys in the background with the grain, totally makes this stand out for me, at least.  Well done!', '2018-11-01 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7599849, 1227544, 87808, '<td valign="top">Handsome chap he is too, love the portrait, clean, concise, expressive and freckles to die for.   Interesting that it is landscape too, that is different! 8</td>', 'Handsome chap he is too, love the portrait, clean, concise, expressive and freckles to die for.   Interesting that it is landscape too, that is different! 8', '2018-11-01 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
