(7599851, 1227933, 87808, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant, no idea how you managed this much sharpens on the blade, but it is brilliant. Love how you have brought the colours out, I am really enjoying looking at it, well done! 8</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant, no idea how you managed this much sharpens on the blade, but it is brilliant. Love how you have brought the colours out, I am really enjoying looking at it, well done! 8', '2018-11-01 10:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
