(7600781, 1227514, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this - it has a visual impact which does now quite get to the WOW! level but it is certainly most pleasing in a very subtle way.</td>', 'I like this - it has a visual impact which does now quite get to the WOW! level but it is certainly most pleasing in a very subtle way.', '2018-11-05 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600782, 1227843, 101256, '<td valign="top">I captured a similar image years ago, but it didn''t have the same mystique and  detail this has - the visual impact is above average, but the subtle touch of color just adds rather than subtract from the over all impact.</td>', 'I captured a similar image years ago, but it didn''t have the same mystique and  detail this has - the visual impact is above average, but the subtle touch of color just adds rather than subtract from the over all impact.', '2018-11-05 11:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600783, 1227705, 101256, '<td valign="top">A subject close to me personally as I have suffered through this until I had corrective surgery - I like the choice of B&amp;W as it really shows the struggle with low vision. Nicely done.</td>', 'A subject close to me personally as I have suffered through this until I had corrective surgery - I like the choice of B&W as it really shows the struggle with low vision. Nicely done.', '2018-11-05 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600784, 1227912, 101256, '<td valign="top">Probably just me, but this seems a little washed out to me - it is a nice image as it is, but the over all pale tone doesn''t to the image justice.</td>', 'Probably just me, but this seems a little washed out to me - it is a nice image as it is, but the over all pale tone doesn''t to the image justice.', '2018-11-05 11:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600785, 1227781, 101256, '<td valign="top">Images like this are difficult, but this has a lot to recommend it - normally the sun is over done, but this is perfect with no noticeable "blooming". The one thing I don''t like is the over all "orange" effect leaving the green detail missing - it might have been better to layer this image to get the greenery into some more color detail.</td>', 'Images like this are difficult, but this has a lot to recommend it - normally the sun is over done, but this is perfect with no noticeable "blooming". The one thing I don''t like is the over all "orange" effect leaving the green detail missing - it might have been better to layer this image to get the greenery into some more color detail.', '2018-11-05 11:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600786, 1227901, 101256, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect and deserves a high mark for creativity. I would have preferred a "landscape" view rather than portrait, but it does work this way. Clever title wins the day - the image ain''t to bad either.</td>', 'The title is perfect and deserves a high mark for creativity. I would have preferred a "landscape" view rather than portrait, but it does work this way. Clever title wins the day - the image ain''t to bad either.', '2018-11-05 11:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600787, 1227990, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous conversion - my favorite format. Great detail and purpose. Not much to nitpick here - well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous conversion - my favorite format. Great detail and purpose. Not much to nitpick here - well done.', '2018-11-05 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600788, 1227477, 101256, '<td valign="top">Autumn colors are touch and in this is a good example - there seems to be a lack of "vibrancy" if you will - however the detail is excellent and the overall framing of the image nearly perfect.  There is something missing however that I can''t put my finger on - perhaps a little more color boost? Still, a worthy image - nicely done.</td>', 'Autumn colors are touch and in this is a good example - there seems to be a lack of "vibrancy" if you will - however the detail is excellent and the overall framing of the image nearly perfect.  There is something missing however that I can''t put my finger on - perhaps a little more color boost? Still, a worthy image - nicely done.', '2018-11-05 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600789, 1227962, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes its better to let the image speak for itself - this is one of those perfect images. Love it.</td>', 'Sometimes its better to let the image speak for itself - this is one of those perfect images. Love it.', '2018-11-05 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600790, 1227894, 101256, '<td valign="top">Whoever submitted these two images is a freakin'' editing genius - this image it much better than the first I saw and has that certain "WOW!!!" factor that makes it great.  Definitely a top five image at minimum, the winner if I had anything to say about it. Well done.</td>', 'Whoever submitted these two images is a freakin'' editing genius - this image it much better than the first I saw and has that certain "WOW!!!" factor that makes it great.  Definitely a top five image at minimum, the winner if I had anything to say about it. Well done.', '2018-11-05 11:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600791, 1227847, 101256, '<td valign="top">I used to love walking the beach with my camera in hand - it was so much fun - this reminds me of those times - I think the image could be improved substantially if the top third was cropped out.</td>', 'I used to love walking the beach with my camera in hand - it was so much fun - this reminds me of those times - I think the image could be improved substantially if the top third was cropped out.', '2018-11-05 11:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600792, 1227805, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ah - the Cinque Terre village of Roimaggiore. beautiful place. Visited there years ago and really enjoyed myself. Nice capture and a high mark just for nostalgia''s sake.</td>', 'Ah - the Cinque Terre village of Roimaggiore. beautiful place. Visited there years ago and really enjoyed myself. Nice capture and a high mark just for nostalgia''s sake.', '2018-11-05 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600793, 1227802, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful example of light and shadow combining into an outstanding image. This is just so perfect it defies description. I can''t nitpick anything - well I could but that would be silly - great shot - I''d like this to place somewhere in the top Five - maybe #2 as I''ve already picked my candidate for #1. :)</td>', 'Wonderful example of light and shadow combining into an outstanding image. This is just so perfect it defies description. I can''t nitpick anything - well I could but that would be silly - great shot - I''d like this to place somewhere in the top Five - maybe #2 as I''ve already picked my candidate for #1. :)', '2018-11-05 11:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600794, 1227717, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice night capture - not much to the image in general, but it does capture a lot of detail that is fun to look at. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice night capture - not much to the image in general, but it does capture a lot of detail that is fun to look at. Nicely done.', '2018-11-05 11:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600798, 1227921, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve come back to this several times - first time I didn''t like it, second time I saw somethings that I liked and the third time, I''m torn between bad and just ok.  I''m going to opt for ok because I hate being negative without being constructive. I think I understand what the author was going for here but, not to put too fine a point on it, it isn''t quite there. The foreground creates a different impression than the background and now that I think about it, it might have made for a much more impactful image if the top third was cropped out - the result would have been much more meaningful and have significantly more impact. A little lighter on the contract would also have helped the foreground.  Sorry for this being so long, but the image had a great deal of potential to my way of thinking.</td>', 'I''ve come back to this several times - first time I didn''t like it, second time I saw somethings that I liked and the third time, I''m torn between bad and just ok.  I''m going to opt for ok because I hate being negative without being constructive. I think I understand what the author was going for here but, not to put too fine a point on it, it isn''t quite there. The foreground creates a different impression than the background and now that I think about it, it might have made for a much more impactful image if the top third was cropped out - the result would have been much more meaningful and have significantly more impact. A little lighter on the contract would also have helped the foreground.  Sorry for this being so long, but the image had a great deal of potential to my way of thinking.', '2018-11-05 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600799, 1227952, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail - that is a great capture - beautiful.</td>', 'Gorgeous detail - that is a great capture - beautiful.', '2018-11-05 11:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600801, 1228011, 101256, '<td valign="top">Finally - my personal favorite format - abstracts. I love working with images to make this this way or that way and make it meaningful. This image reminds me a lot of Theo van Doesburg''s art - he had a way with shapes that really make you follow the curves and shapes to entertain the brain. This is a perfect example of that - I spent a great deal of time just looking at this - it is a perfect example of art in the form of photography - a nexus of purpose and meaning. Well done - excellent. I hope the author takes first place.</td>', 'Finally - my personal favorite format - abstracts. I love working with images to make this this way or that way and make it meaningful. This image reminds me a lot of Theo van Doesburg''s art - he had a way with shapes that really make you follow the curves and shapes to entertain the brain. This is a perfect example of that - I spent a great deal of time just looking at this - it is a perfect example of art in the form of photography - a nexus of purpose and meaning. Well done - excellent. I hope the author takes first place.', '2018-11-05 11:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600802, 1227786, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really like this because that''s the way I look most of the time - great image capturing the essence of the subject''s personality.</td>', 'I really like this because that''s the way I look most of the time - great image capturing the essence of the subject''s personality.', '2018-11-05 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600803, 1227644, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good capture - good detail, splash of red color - not a great image, but it still has a certain "panache''" if you will. Nice job.</td>', 'Good capture - good detail, splash of red color - not a great image, but it still has a certain "panache''" if you will. Nice job.', '2018-11-05 11:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600804, 1228017, 101256, '<td valign="top">What a nifty capture - I would have cropped off at the cloud line, but that is a personal choice. Definitely a top 10, if not a top five image.</td>', 'What a nifty capture - I would have cropped off at the cloud line, but that is a personal choice. Definitely a top 10, if not a top five image.', '2018-11-05 12:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600805, 1227956, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think the title would have worked as Snake Eye, but that''s a personal choice. Great detail, nice shutter speed with the appropriate DOF. Hope the author was using a long lens. :)</td>', 'I think the title would have worked as Snake Eye, but that''s a personal choice. Great detail, nice shutter speed with the appropriate DOF. Hope the author was using a long lens. :)', '2018-11-05 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600806, 1227709, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another beach picture that brings a lot of nostalgia for me. I used to take my Border Collie Skye to the beach - it was her favorite place to just run and annoy the surf fishing. Very nice conversion - a personal fave.</td>', 'Another beach picture that brings a lot of nostalgia for me. I used to take my Border Collie Skye to the beach - it was her favorite place to just run and annoy the surf fishing. Very nice conversion - a personal fave.', '2018-11-05 12:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600807, 1228015, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - very competent capture. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful image - very competent capture. Well done.', '2018-11-05 12:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600809, 1227518, 101256, '<td valign="top">This seems a little washed out to me - it could use a little more color density. Still, a peaceful calm image with some good detail. Nicely done.</td>', 'This seems a little washed out to me - it could use a little more color density. Still, a peaceful calm image with some good detail. Nicely done.', '2018-11-05 12:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
