(7600833, 1227989, 101256, '<td valign="top">I looked at this several times and have rated it accordingly, but this time I''m bumping it up to an 8 - it definitely captures the imagination and is very creative.  Not a perfect image, but close enough. Well done.,</td>', 'I looked at this several times and have rated it accordingly, but this time I''m bumping it up to an 8 - it definitely captures the imagination and is very creative.  Not a perfect image, but close enough. Well done.,', '2018-11-05 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7600834, 1227964, 101256, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it was just another horse picture. On the third rating/commentary phase, I''ve changed my mind - rich detail, almost perfect conversion, the essence of the personality of the horse comes through - very nearly perfect. Well done. from a 6 to an 8.</td>', 'At first glance, it was just another horse picture. On the third rating/commentary phase, I''ve changed my mind - rich detail, almost perfect conversion, the essence of the personality of the horse comes through - very nearly perfect. Well done. from a 6 to an 8.', '2018-11-05 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
