(7600836, 1227975, 101256, '<td valign="top">In some ways this challenge should be called the "challenge of the neutral tones" or "battle of the beige". I like the scope and expanse of the image - the subject fits nicely into the overall gestalt of the image - upgrade from 6 to a 7.</td>', 'In some ways this challenge should be called the "challenge of the neutral tones" or "battle of the beige". I like the scope and expanse of the image - the subject fits nicely into the overall gestalt of the image - upgrade from 6 to a 7.', '2018-11-05 13:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
