(7601487, 1227836, 86218, '<td valign="top">What a lovely setting and exposure handled well/well processed. These kind of shots inspire one to get back in to nature with camera and not simply walk through it. If possible, try and clone out that water droplet that most likely ended up on your lens. Happens to me and hate it when it happens. Congrats with the HM.</td>', 'What a lovely setting and exposure handled well/well processed. These kind of shots inspire one to get back in to nature with camera and not simply walk through it. If possible, try and clone out that water droplet that most likely ended up on your lens. Happens to me and hate it when it happens. Congrats with the HM.', '2018-11-08 02:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7601488, 1227544, 30214, '<td valign="top">very nice work. So much character!</td>', 'very nice work. So much character!', '2018-11-08 03:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
