(7601589, 1227843, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JulietNN:</b></div><hr/><i> And as gorgeous as this photo is, the wedding photos are even better! Congratulations on all of life that you having right now! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>thank you Juliet! Actually, we are now eagerly expecting our "official" wedding photos from none other than our very own DPCer Julia Bailey (<img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=200" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">grigrigirl</a>)!</td>', 'Originally posted by JulietNN: And as gorgeous as this photo is, the wedding photos are even better! Congratulations on all of life that you having right now!  thank you Juliet! Actually, we are now eagerly expecting our "official" wedding photos from none other than our very own DPCer Julia Bailey ( grigrigirl)!', '2018-11-08 14:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
